    <briefdescription>
<para>A ZSTD-compressed Raft snapshot ready for storage or transfer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Follows the Raft paper §7: the snapshot records the last included index and term so that the log can be safely truncated up to that point. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
